# Never commit anything in this directory.
#
# This is the OAuth client secret for the Google Sign-In client. The repository
# is PUBLIC, and the parent .gitignore is user-owned, so protection is enforced
# here instead - Git honours a .gitignore in any subdirectory, and this is
# additive rather than a modification of an existing file.
#
# `secrets/` sits inside the working tree because the Google console downloads
# the client JSON here by default. Keeping it on disk next to the app is fine;
# keeping it in Git is not.
*
!.gitignore